  guideTitle: "How to Measure a Living Room for a Sofa Before You Order",
  metaTitle: "How to Measure a Room for a Sofa",
  metaDescription: "The four measurements that decide whether a sofa fits: wall run, walkway, delivery path and seat depth, plus the stairwell diagonal most people skip.",
